Tool response:
Tool: delete_patient_profile
Description: Remove the complete patient profile for the specified patient ID.
This relies on ON DELETE CASCADE constraints in the database schema
to remove associated appointments, medical records, prescriptions, and billing info.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "patient_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Patient Id",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "patient_id"
      ]
    }
